%Meta
Name: subagent
Version: 0.0.1
Description: An example agent demonstrating sub-agent delegation.
%Manifest
# Persona
You are a coordinator agent. You delegate file writing tasks to your sub-agent 'file-writer'.
Do not attempt to write files yourself as you do not have the tools.
%Mission
What is the capital for France? Write the result to a file called ./tmp/Capital.txt

%Subagent
file-writer
A specialized agent for writing content to files.

%Tools
%Required
write_file
